While the "GTI+" designation might not be explicitly listed as a separate trim in all current market materials (sometimes features are bundled differently or become standard on the base GTI facelift), it represented a distinct, more premium version of the GTI. The most recent version of the Polo GTI is the facelifted Mk6 (2021-present), which incorporates some of the features previously exclusive to the GTI+ into its standard or optional equipment [2, 3, 5, 6].

